                <pb facs="0811" n="711" sameAs="frus:frus1920v03/pg711"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">661.4116/28: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Consul General at London</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Skinner</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-05-17T15:00:00+01:00"><hi rendition="#italic">May 17, 1920—3
                                p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 3:20 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Three Russian delegates arrived Sunday night to negotiate with British Government
                    for reopening trade with Russia.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Skinner</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
